WEBVTT

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:17.080
Betrayal Knows My Name

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.530
The pain...

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:49.610
It hurts.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:54.900
Please free me from it...

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:23.230
Luka, please be there for me at the end.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:26.570
If I am destined to die,

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:31.250
I want you to be the one who frees me.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.060
Be the one to kill me.

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:38.670
I'd never do anything to hurt you.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.290
But that's all hypothetical.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.750
I will protect you.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:56.350
Wait!

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:11.110
I will not betray you.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.530
Luka!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.410
Set in Motion

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:40.120
Asahi
Orphanage

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.040
Recently, I've been having strange dreams.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.310
But I can't remember them after I wake up.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:09.090
Yet I get the feeling they're very important
and that I shouldn't forget them.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.080
Yuki.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.330
Kanata-san.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.580
Good morning!

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:20.980
Good morning.

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:23.230
What are you doing here so early?

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:27.470
I thought I'd give you this,
before I head in to the university.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:30.030
Weren't you looking for a picture book?

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:33.930
Thank you! I'll read this to everyone tonight.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.620
I'm sure they'll be overjoyed.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.390
Yuki-kun, good morning!

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.610
Good morning, Kanata-nii.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.030
You're early today!

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:47.030
Kanata-san brought you
all a new picture book.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.640
Awesome!

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.150
Can you read it with us later?

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.370
We'll read it after school, okay?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.010
Hurray!

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.790
I love you, Yuki-kun!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.250
Don't run; you might get hurt!

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:06.880
That was a close match the other day.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:07.400
Thank you. It was all due
to your coaching.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.900
First Place

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:10.350
Third Place - Sakurai Yuki

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:14.640
I'm sorry I made you participate
in my hobby after work.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.840
Not at all.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.480
So, was there something you wanted?

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:25.960
Kanata-san brought this for everyone.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.670
He's here?

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:28.280
Yes.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:32.740
I wish he'd come to see me sometime.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:35.830
I think he had to call his boss.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.870
He's outside right now.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.540
He seems to be doing well.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.770
By the way, Yuki...

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:44.800
Yes?

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.180
I heard you're looking for a place to live.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.010
Yes.

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.200
There's no need to hurry.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.820
You don't need to find one right away.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.830
There's still time until graduation.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.440
This is your home.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:03.590
Thank you.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:07.000
I'll take the time to think it over.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:11.410
Yuki-kun, could you get the newspaper?

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:12.910
I forgot all about it.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:13.870
Sure.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.960
Sakurai Yuki, die!!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.060
This is the second letter.

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:47.340
Maybe no one needs me, after all...

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:55.910
When you were a baby, I found you
crying by the orphanage fence.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:07:01.350
Aside from a note with "Yuki" written on it,
we had no clues to your identity.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:09.360
Did my father and mother not need me?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.820
Yuki...

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.870
I just want someone

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.320
to tell me why I was born...

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.450
Why I'm here...

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.350
Y-Yes?

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:34.240
Yuki, wanna keep me company
and walk with me?

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.070
I'll be right there.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.710
I'll ask an acquaintance about an apartment.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.040
Could you stop by after class?

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.170
Yes.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:49.880
Something on your mind?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.930
You don't look well.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:59.320
Oh, it's nothing.
I probably just need to catch up on sleep.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:01.130
Are you having trouble sleeping?

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.820
I've been having lots of dreams lately.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.320
Dreams?

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:09.320
But when I wake up, I can't
remember them very well.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.940
If you need someone to talk to, I'll listen.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:19.260
You always try to handle things alone.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.850
All right. I'll see you later.

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.130
That's odd...

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.130
It should be here soon.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.750
The Sparrow Express?

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.840
Yeah.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.180
He's close.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.470
She's cute, isn't she?

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:46.140
Yuki-chan hasn't changed a bit.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.250
She's a boy now.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:52.350
Whatever. Boys can be cute, too.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.950
Hey! You kids!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.030
What do you want, old man?

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:58.940
Everyone else is lining up. Follow the rules.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.950
Rules, huh?

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.750
Get out of here, moron!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:10.790
You got ten seconds to get up or you lose.
It's in the rules, old man.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:14.220
You've got to follow the rules.
You're an adult.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.640
I'll be right back.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.040
Wait, Toko-chan.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:22.460
You've got to give those kids an
earful before they'll listen!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:24.300
I'll do it, then.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.560
Please stop!

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:28.940
If you don't stop, he'll die.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.560
Who do you think you are?

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:35.730
You look like a girl. Don't blame me
if you get yourself hurt.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.280
Wonderful, Yuki-chan!

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.400
L-Let go of me...

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.540
I'm sorry. It's a habit.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:51.000
Shut up! Let me go, already!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:58.400
<i>I'll never forgive my good-for-nothing father.</i>

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:00.660
<i>He betrayed us, his family.</i>

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.390
<i>I'll never forgive him!</i>

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.540
It's happening again...

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:09.350
You punk. You think you're so tough-

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.900
How lame...

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:16.870
Ready to give it a rest?

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:18.990
I called the cops.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.650
Let's go!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:25.550
You called the cops?

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:26.890
Nope. I lied.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.000
Excuse me...

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.930
Thank you very much!

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:31.020
You should be more careful.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.690
You're strong, but there
were three of them.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.460
And lots of people don't
understand others' pain.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:43.010
I wish it weren't the case,
but not everyone's a good Samaritan.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:48.470
All I could think about was saving him.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:49.870
You...

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.020
...are too kind for your own good!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:59.970
But I prefer people who help others,
without self-regard, over those

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.570
who ignore people's problems.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.220
I'm sure we'll get along.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.470
See you around.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.660
See you later, Yuki.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:11.750
Wait!

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.310
How did they know my name?

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.160
Sakurai-kun! Sakurai-kun!

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:49.250
I heard you got in a fight
with some delinquents.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.120
You beat them up, right?

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.530
You're so cool...

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:54.550
You're really great!

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.000
Oh, uh...

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.590
You look so cute, but you're tough!

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:02.300
Did you know you've got
a bunch of fans now?

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.640
Of course, I'm one, too!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:04.690
That's, um...

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.360
He's turning red!

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:07.300
So cute...

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:10.050
S-Sorry. I've got to go!

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.390
Sakurai-kun!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.200
Hey, wait.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.730
He's too cute.

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:17.020
Uzuki-kun.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.590
Good morning.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:24.070
Are you taking care of these
flowers, Uzuki-kun?

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.390
They're beautiful.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.680
Yeah...

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:32.800
Huh? You've got a red spot here.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.150
<i>What are you looking at?!</i>

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:44.090
<i>Why did you have to be born?</i>

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:49.640
<i>Without you, my life could
have been different.</i>

00:12:56.660 --> 00:13:00.020
Uzuki-kun, are you all right?

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:03.780
You're doing it again...

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.280
S-Sorry! I didn't mean to!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.020
There he is.

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:09.990
Shut up!

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.660
Uzuki-kun.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.020
What was that about?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.110
Gross.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.740
I don't understand him.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:22.050
Don't worry about him, Sakurai-kun.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:24.050
He's been really weird lately.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:30.320
I live near him.
His mother's not all there...

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:33.810
Apparently, she's almost
killed him a few times.

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:36.520
But it's all just rumors.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:41.560
Damn it! He's always pitying me!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.440
Let go of me!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.530
What do you know?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.400
What's his problem?

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.830
You're pathetic.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.160
Who's there?

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:03.500
I've been watching you from above.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.560
I felt bad for you.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.200
You understand, don't you?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.380
That's why you sent those letters.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.810
Those death threats!

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:22.380
It's his fault... Acting like the good guy...

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.840
It's going to his head.

00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:28.830
He acts like he knows everything!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.520
I just wanted to scare him a little.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.540
That's why I...

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:35.990
Exactly.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:41.710
It's not your fault.
You've done nothing wrong.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.320
That's right.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.960
It's not my fault.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.640
He's the one in the wrong.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:09.480
I found a few places for you.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.350
Thank you.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:14.320
If you don't find anything you like,
I'll keep looking.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.340
Okay.

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:18.720
Did something happen?

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:19.410
Huh?

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.080
Remember what I told you this morning?

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.840
You can talk to me about anything.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.830
I'm fine. It's nothing.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.840
Anyway, thank you for these.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.610
I'm sure one of these will work out.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:37.590
Well, there's still plenty of time
before graduation. Pace yourself.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:42.020
I want to be like you, Kanata-san.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:53.280
On your own, working your
way through college...

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.600
That's just great.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.450
Huh? What's this book?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:05.260
It's the only thing I had with me when
I arrived at the orphanage.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.380
What does it say?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:12.420
<i>The Key of Raziel</i>.

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:15.810
Recently, I learned how to read it.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:21.890
What is it about?

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:25.900
Something that would be
of benefit to the world.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.050
To the world...

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:34.780
Did you know the world is slowly
moving toward its destruction?

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.800
Meteorological abnormalities caused
by environmental pollution...

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:44.090
Hunger, terrorism, and wars driven
by racism and religion...

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:50.090
Humans are foolish and
deeply sinful creatures.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:54.210
Yuki...

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:54.880
Yes?

00:16:55.630 --> 00:17:01.180
We must reset everything,
to cleanse this tainted world.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.480
Don't you agree?

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:15.850
Today, Kanata-san seemed a little different.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:20.310
What did he mean by "reset" the world?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.670
Yuki-kun! We're done brushing our teeth.

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:26.050
Read to us.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:28.350
Come on. Let's play some more.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:30.230
I want to read, too!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.430
Why don't I tell you a story today?

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.540
Yay!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:44.220
Once upon a time, a prince and a
princess lived alone in an empty field.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:48.460
They had only recently met,

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.950
but they felt like they had known
each other for a long time.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.190
And they quickly became friends.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.210
But why was that?

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.070
They had just met for the first time.

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:02.700
The princess thought it very strange,
so she asked the prince...

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:07.000
"Is this really the first time we've met?"

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.460
The prince replied.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.650
"I think this is our first meeting,

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:17.340
but I know you. And you know me."

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.400
The prince smiled and said...

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:23.250
"We were destined to meet

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:27.990
because of the promise we made to God."

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.580
Yuki-chan.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.200
I love you.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.460
Good night.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.030
Help.
-Uzuki

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.350
Uzuki-kun!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.610
Uzuki-kun?

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.050
My legs!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.350
Help!

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:00.600
Are you hurt?

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:03.700
I'm fine.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:10.040
<i>It's like these silver eyes
woke my sleeping heart.</i>

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:12.460
<i>How best to describe it?</i>

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:15.420
<i>Oh, that's right.</i>

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:19.030
<i>Like they're not of this world.</i>

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:22.360
<i>These eyes...</i>

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.880
I finally found you.

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.110
What was that?

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.360
Be careful.

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:31.770
Careful?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.190
Uzuki-kun!

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.430
It was an illusion.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:42.490
An illusion?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.660
An illusion is darkness.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.870
Those who cannot see the darkness

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:54.630
cannot resist its sweet temptation
and are stained black.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:21:02.070
Eventually, the darkness envelops
the light, controlling everything.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.450
The darkness controls everything?

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.500
Sound familiar?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.630
Die.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.960
It can't be.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:14.690
I'm here.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.140
Don't try taking on everything alone.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.280
I will save you,

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:28.660
Yuki!

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.450
How do you know my name?

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.830
I will not betray you.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:44.510
What is this feeling of nostalgia?

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.730
What should I do?

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:00.110
I'm on the verge of tears.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.040
Yuki, do you have any nail clippers?

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:40.470
Yeah, in the second drawer.

00:23:40.470 --> 00:23:43.000
Wait. You cut your nails, Luka?

00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:45.500
Even I cut my nails.

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:45.980
Don't cut too deeply.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:47.790
Eternal Investigation

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:49.780
Sure. I'll be careful.

